  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HintUI
  Hints:
  - explosions dont hurt you, but may send you flying into harms way
  - explosions spread fire, which can burn roots and set off bombs
  - collecting enough treasure will heal you, but gets costly overtime
  - power ups max at 4 levels, but collecting more will keep the timer full
  - 'Fire bullets will ignite tiles they pass '
